895
01:26:34,092 --> 01:26:35,592
Anna: Can you give us an example?
Bạn cho một ví dụ được không?

896
01:26:36,042 --> 01:26:46,872
Ben: Sure. "Hi David, it's Ben. I'm not feeling very well. I've got a sore throat and a headache. I need to call in sick today. Tom can help with the report if it's urgent."
